          "duration": 0.174,
          "bounce": 0
        },
        "samples": 4,
        "rmsPx": 0.17
      },
      "separators": "keyed by the integer digits after them: a separator that ends up between other digits drops out, slides over and rises back in 55 ms later; a new one rises in",
